+# Tasks
+
+## 1. Stock service and conflict handling
+
+- [x] 1.1 Trace the existing product quantity, inventory, cart, and order repositories and introduce a shared stock operation that resolves each line by its product identity/SKU; verify with focused unit tests that decrement and restore affect only the matching product.
+- [x] 1.2 Add the stock-insufficient conflict exception and map it to HTTP 409; verify controller-level tests receive 409 for rejected stock operations.
+- [x] 1.3 Make stock validation and mutation transactional and safe against negative quantities/concurrent checkout; verify rollback tests show no partial inventory changes.
+
+## 2. Cart stock enforcement
+
+- [x] 2.1 Enforce stock limits for cart creation and single-item updates, preserving decreases/removals; verify anonymous and authenticated cart API tests cover success, zero stock, excess quantity, and unchanged-cart 409 behavior.
+- [x] 2.2 Enforce all multi-item cart changes through a validate-then-apply transaction; verify one invalid line causes HTTP 409 and no line changes while valid batches update all lines.
+
+## 3. Checkout and order cancellation
+
+- [x] 3.1 Apply complete-cart stock validation before both anonymous and authenticated checkout order creation, then decrement each matching product by its ordered quantity; verify successful checkout, insufficient stock, no-order, no-stock-change, and unchanged-cart scenarios.
+- [x] 3.2 Restore stock on the first transition to CANCELED, make repeated cancellation idempotent, and reject transitions away from CANCELED with HTTP 409; verify order status integration tests for all status paths.
+
+## 4. Product availability and integration verification
+
+- [x] 4.1 Populate v2 product `available` and `canBePurchased` from positive stock plus merchant availability, including restock behavior; verify SKU API tests for zero stock, restock, and merchant-disabled products.
+- [x] 4.2 Run the focused stock/cart/order/product test suites and the relevant Maven module build; verify the complete regression set passes.
